# Staggered Card Number — a card number whose first 12 digits flip, one after
# another (withDelay stagger + spring), into blurred dots when the eye button
# is tapped, and back when tapped again (animated BlurView intensity per digit).
# What this test covers: hide and reveal with each stagger left to finish,
# toggling back mid-stagger (springs reversed while later digits are still
# delayed), a rapid burst of toggles ending in each state, and a
# press-and-hold on the animated-pressable button.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/staggered-card-number"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "text" "Number" 30000
wait 1000
# Eye button (unlabeled icon): tap by position.
press 329 439
wait 1500
press 329 439
wait 1500
# Reverse mid-stagger.
press 329 439
wait 150
press 329 439
wait 1500
# Rapid toggles (odd count: ends hidden), then even (ends hidden too).
press 329 439
wait 90
press 329 439
wait 90
press 329 439
wait 90
press 329 439
wait 90
press 329 439
wait 1500
press 329 439 --count 6 --interval-ms 100
wait 1500
# Hold then release: reveals.
longpress 329 439 700
wait 1500
wait "text" "Number" 8000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
